%% Overall 3-tier architecture — see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
graph TB
    subgraph Internet
        User[("End user browser")]
        CI["GitHub Actions CI/CD"]
    end

    subgraph "Public network (tier: public)"
        Nginx["Nginx reverse proxy<br/>TLS termination, rate limiting,<br/>security headers, blue/green router"]
    end

    subgraph "Private network (tier: private)"
        OdooBlue["Odoo (blue)"]
        OdooGreen["Odoo (green, idle)"]
    end

    subgraph "Database network (tier: database, internal=true, no egress)"
        PgBouncer["PgBouncer<br/>session pooling, auth_query"]
        Postgres[("PostgreSQL<br/>dedicated least-privilege role")]
    end

    subgraph "Monitoring network"
        Prometheus["Prometheus"]
        Grafana["Grafana"]
        Loki["Loki"]
        Alertmanager["Alertmanager"]
    end

    subgraph "Object storage (optional, terraform/modules/object_storage)"
        S3[("S3 backup bucket<br/>encrypted, versioned, immutable")]
    end

    User -->|HTTPS 443| Nginx
    Nginx -->|active upstream| OdooBlue
    Nginx -.->|idle, warmed during deploy| OdooGreen
    OdooBlue --> PgBouncer
    OdooGreen --> PgBouncer
    PgBouncer --> Postgres

    CI -->|build, scan, sign, push| Registry[("Container registry<br/>Harbor / GHCR")]
    CI -->|SSH deploy, blue/green flip| Nginx
    Registry -->|pull validated digest| OdooBlue

    Prometheus -->|scrape| Nginx
    Prometheus -->|scrape| Postgres
    Prometheus -->|scrape| OdooBlue
    Prometheus --> Alertmanager
    Grafana --> Prometheus
    Grafana --> Loki

    Postgres -->|restic backup| S3
